 "text": "Foster County, North Dakota\nMENU\nDepartments ► Additional County Entities\nAuditor's Office\nCentral Prairie Human Service Zone\nCommission\nCustodian\nDistrict Court\nEmergency Management/911 Coordinator\nExtension\nPlanning and Zoning\nPublic Health\nPublic Transportation\nRecorder's Office\nRoad Department\nSheriff's Office\nState's Attorney's Office\nTax Equalization\nTownship Support\nTreasurer's Office\nVeterans Service Office\nWater Board\nUseful Links\nForms & Documents\nCounty Fair\nNews\nEvents\nEmployment\nContact\nJuanita Lake\nDepartments Additional County Entities\nAuditor's Office\nCentral Prairie Human Service Zone\nCommission\nCustodian\nDistrict Court\nEmergency Management/911 Coordinator\nExtension\nPlanning and Zoning\nPublic Health\nPublic Transportation\nRecorder's Office\nRoad Department\nSheriff's Office\nState's Attorney's Office\nTax Equalization\nTownship Support\nTreasurer's Office\nVeterans Service Office\nWater Board\nUseful Links\nForms & Documents\nCounty Fair\nNews\nEvents\nEmployment\nContact\nJuanita Lake\nSearch Website:\nWelcome to Foster County, North Dakota\nFoster County consists of 644 square miles of land located in the center of North Dakota. It is the smallest of the state's 53 counties and is bordered by Eddy , Griggs, Stutsman , and Wells counties. Below is some useful information regarding the county:\nFoster County is divided into 18 townships.\nThe seat of the county government is located in Carrington, ND.\nThere are five County Commissioners, elected per district.\nThere are four school districts in Foster County being Carrington , New Rockford , Kensal and Midkota .\nThe four cities in Foster County include Carrington , Glenfield , McHenry, & Grace City\nContact Us\nCounty Departments\nCourthouse Hours:\nThe Foster County Courthouse Hours:\nMonday - Thursday 8:00 AM - 12:00 PM and 1:00 PM to 4:30 PM\nFriday 8:00 AM - 1:00 PM\nThe Foster County Road Department is open:\nSummer Hours: 7:00 AM - 5:00 PM Monday thru Thursday\nWinter Hours 7:00 AM - 3:30 PM Monday thru Friday\nPay your property taxes HERE!\nClick the image below to make a payment!\nView Full Contact Information\nBurn Ban: On Load Restrictions: Off\nNews & Updates\nNDSU Extension Mill Levy - Ballot Question\nPosted on 09-15-2026\nView All News & Updates\nUpcoming Events\n2026 Foster County Commissioner Meeting\n10-20-2026\n2026 Foster County Commissioner Meeting\n11-05-2026\nView All Events\nLatest Commission Minutes\nSeptember 1, 2026 - (PDF)\nView All Minutes\nLatest Minutes\n10-01-2026 - Special Meeting (Draft Minutes) - Water Board\nSeptember 9, 2026 - (Draft Minutes) - Water Board\nView All Minutes\nQuick Links\nBe Cyber Smart | Elections | Fire Index | Foster County Emergency Management Blog | Historical Information | Public Transportation | Anonymous Tip Line | Emergency Alert System Registration | Tip411 Anonymous Tip Line | Tip 411 Alert Sign Up\nCopyright © 2017 - 2026 Foster County and it's licensors.\nPrivacy Policy | Contact Us",
